@startuml
[*] --> Idle
Idle --> FormBeingFilled : User starts filling a form
FormBeingFilled --> AutoFillInProgress : User requests auto-fill
AutoFillInProgress --> FormBeingFilled : Auto-fill completes
FormBeingFilled --> SavingFilledInformation : User saves filled information
SavingFilledInformation --> FormCompleted : Information saved
FormCompleted --> [*] : Form submission completed
FormCompleted --> SavingFilledInformation : User requests save
@enduml
